          "summary": "Add TrueLink indemnity for third-party IP infringement, breach of law, data breach and wilful misconduct; limit Client's indemnity to Client Content and Client's breach of law",
          "comment": "[Playbook] TrueLink's indemnity at 12.b reaches only its own breach of this Agreement, so we have added clause c. covering third-party IP infringement claims against the Interface and Services, TrueLink's breach of law, TrueLink-caused data breach and gross negligence/wilful misconduct, with the usual notice, control and cooperation procedure. We have also narrowed Client's indemnity at 12.a to Client Content and Client's breach of applicable law, consistent with our playbook position.",
